  <item>
    <title>vol.2 回看童年，原来我们都是刀尖上舔血长大的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6605e71f1519139e4f3d994d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6605e71f1519139e4f3d994d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Mar 2024 21:54:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这集突发奇想的节目，源于Cherry的父亲当天毫无缘由的在微信上连发10多张照片。那一刻死去的记忆如万马奔腾般向Cherry呼啸而来！</span></p><span></span><p><span>最终，对话结尾是Cherry父亲发来的那一句“宝宝，你能平安长大还真挺不容易的！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝所有父母快乐育儿，祝所有孩子平安成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> 在脸上反复打磨的搓澡巾，是正义利器，你的“道德污点”让爸爸来搓净</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">05:17</a> 被爸爸一碗炒面粉一杯白开水拉扯大的老王，如今也是个1米83的燕赵男子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">07:21</a> 手指被夹了别害怕，爸爸让你哭的更大声</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="537">08:57</a> 妈妈我不怕冷，我更怕二氧化碳中毒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 原以为眼角的疤是娘胎里带的，长大后您说是高压电线杆赐我的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="848">14:08</a> 妈妈你的社牛太耀眼，让我睁不开眼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> 姥姥习得的巫蛊之术，让我望而却步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1287">21:27</a> 神之圣手，结节消退</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a> 爸爸对女儿的如山父爱，化为吉列剃须刀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1561">26:01</a> 嗷嗷待哺的父母</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2018">33:38</a> 酒吧、ktv、游乐场，你和闺蜜们的聚会，爸爸绝不缺席！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/li6F0ekzIxtrVNptbz0kKMkuSf5N.m4a" length="70089024" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:36:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZvMjh3TjU2MHl1ankwMVdMTE5TdXNHZDNKUTMucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.1 放过自己吧，别再自我PUA了！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6499e8fdd6cdb597286dbbdc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6499e8fdd6cdb597286dbbdc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Jun 2023 04:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>甭管哭湿多少鼻涕纸，嘴里的零食就没停过</span></p><span></span><p><span>几度对着话筒没勇气再聊了，峰回路转笑着收场</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqnh_5b7fH4PtmJbY8jtlFUdDWT0.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 我想面对面和你说说话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="321">05:21</a> 为工作披荆斩棘成了奇奇蒂蒂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="438">07:18</a> 那些矫情的崩溃瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">09:29</a> 以为自己是自由战士，末了还是被精神内耗了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="787">13:07</a> 友人间的话疗二人组</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="945">15:45</a> 朋友崩溃焦虑的当下，请停止你的传道授业&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> 放过自己，休息片刻，你值得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1114">18:34</a> 当我意识到自己居然变成内心最惧怕的奴性生物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1351">22:31</a> 人情味儿浓郁小城镇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1422">23:42</a> 在自我PUA中奋力自救</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1458">24:18</a> 是真正具备独立思考能力，还是被大数据教化出的三好生&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1617">26:57</a> 结识到优秀可爱的人之后，我更厌恶自己了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1765">29:25</a> 庆幸自我警醒，使我奋起反抗焦虑情绪&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1837">30:37</a> 毕业生们，别怕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2001">33:21</a> “所有的好事坏事，到最后都用得上”&amp;“不早不晚，刚刚好”&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小柯-日子</span></p><span></span><p><span>London Festival Orchestra-Carmen</span></p><span></span><p><span>臧天朔-朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>Orchestra Of The Moscow Bach Centre/Sergey Miassojedov/Albert Razbaum/Johann Sebastian Bach-Suite No. 2 in B Minor BWV 1067: Badinerie</span></p><span></span><p><span>spill tab-Cotton Candy</span></p><span></span><p><span>James Newton Howard/Jennifer Lawrence-The Hanging TreeJames Newton Howard/Jennifer Lawrence</span></p><span></span><p><span>FINNEAS-Only A Lifetime</span></p><span></span><p><span>Angus &amp; Julia Stone-Chateau (Acoustic)</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljwG1NcVHYY82M356EqGFHVvGlTD.m4a" length="74029345" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:19</itunes:duration>
